-
-config MTD_NAND_SLC_LPC32XX
-	tristate "NXP LPC32xx SLC Controller"
-	depends on ARCH_LPC32XX
-	help
-	  Enables support for NXP's LPC32XX SLC (i.e. for Single Level Cell
