+ * Copyright (c) Ian Molton 2004, 2005, 2008
+ *    Original work, independent of sharps code. Included hardware ECC support.
+ *    Hard ECC did not work for writes in the early revisions.
+ * Copyright (c) Dirk Opfer 2005.
